*Technologies understood conceptually or used minimally in past roles or side projects:*

| Skill / Technology | Familiarity | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **React Native** | Intermediate | Built small cross-platform prototypes; understands Expo |
| **Docker** | Intermediate | Running local containerized development environments |
| **SQL / PostgreSQL** | Moderate | Basic relational queries and database seeding |
| **WebSockets** | Moderate | Real-time chat integration in earlier client projects |

