## Tier 4: Want to Learn / Target Brush-Up Areas
*Areas to review or study for senior roles:*

- **3D Web Interactive Graphics (Three.js / WebGL / React Three Fiber)**
- **WebAssembly (Rust/Wasm integration in the browser)**
- **Advanced Microfrontend Architectures (Module Federation at scale)**

---

## Tier 5: Explicitly AVOID (Deal-Breakers & Drainers)
*Technologies or roles you do NOT want to work with in your daily stack:*

- **Legacy jQuery / AngularJS (v1.x) / Backbone.js maintenance**
- **100% monolithic PHP/WordPress theme hacking with no modern build tools**
- **Roles without dedicated designers where engineers guess UI specs**
- **Micromanagement or activity-tracking environments**
